Strangler-Fig migration milestone: autopilot/core/ is live.

The generic agent workflows (selector / implementer / reviewer / auditor) and the role-invocation
runtime now live under autopilot/core/, and supervisor.mjs consumes them via createCore({...}) instead
of defining them inline (U-30). The presence of this file lifts the protect.mjs freeze on
supervisor.mjs and watchdog.mjs so the live entry-points may import from core/. The per-file
`node --check` syntax gate still guards every .mjs under autopilot/.
